00:20:22.780 --> 00:20:25.780
And it's this field where--

00:20:25.780 --> 00:20:28.510
essentially it was like kind
of taking IT to the next level.

00:20:28.510 --> 00:20:30.040
So it was the same--
the people who

00:20:30.040 --> 00:20:31.540
