people developing the tools

00:20:40.480 --> 00:20:42.490
to keep the website up.

00:20:42.490 --> 00:20:44.650
And so it's, like,
developer operator.

00:20:44.650 --> 00:20:47.950
And at Google, they kind
of have a different word

00:20:47.950 --> 00:20:50.840
for it, site
reliability engineer,

00:20:50.840 --> 00:20:52.090
