00:23:46.270 --> 00:23:48.270
And I was like, I don't
want to talk about that.

00:23:48.270 --> 00:23:49.750
That seems really hard.

00:23:49.750 --> 00:23:51.940
But then I feel like you
ran with that a little bit.

00:23:51.940 --> 00:23:52.600
Well, first--

