00:25:44.060 --> 00:25:44.560
Anyway.

00:25:44.560 --> 00:25:45.220
No stats.

00:25:45.220 --> 00:25:47.810
Anyway, so you had to like--

00:25:47.810 --> 00:25:51.580
So I started thinking about,
I've had long history of music.

00:25:51.580 --> 00:25:54.068
I played the violin for
know how however old I am,

00:25:54.068 --> 00:25:56.110
30-some years or-- that's
not how old I am, but--

00:25:56.110 --> 00:25:57.460
[LAUGHTER]

00:25:57.460 --> 00:25:59.110
That's how long
