00:56:35.900 --> 00:56:37.493
It's like, oh, you
come to America,

00:56:37.493 --> 00:56:38.660
you have burnt diner coffee.

00:56:38.660 --> 00:56:40.070
It's so bad, it's good.

00:56:40.070 --> 00:56:40.850
Only in America.

00:56:40.850 --> 00:56:42.430
Yeah.

00:56:42.430 --> 00:56:45.410
So let me just explain on
the x-axis is episode number.

00:56:45.410 --> 00:56:48.870
On the y-axis is number of
mentions of the word coffee.

00:56:48.870 --> 00:56:49.760
Yeah.

00:56:49.760 --> 00:56:54.200
It's good to have transcripts,
so thank you stringr package.

00:56:54.200 --> 00:56:56.480
So Hilary switches
tea to coffee.

00:56:56.480 --> 00:56:58.460
This is in episode
36 is where I say

00:56:58.460 --> 00:57:00.840
